{%- comment -%}
News list in the template style: "Mon YYYY: text", newest first, inside a scrollable box.
Items come from the _news collection (one markdown file per item, with a `date` in the front matter).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="news-box">
  <span class="c-link"><ul>
  {%- assign news = site.news | sort: "date" | reverse -%}
  {%- for item in news %}
    <li>{{ item.date | date: "%b %Y" }}: {{ item.content | strip_html | strip }}</li>
  {%- endfor %}
  </ul></span>
</div>
